   "source": [
    "# N = 1 Deep-Dive: Layer × Head Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT-OSS architecture notes (from inspecting the captured attention tensors):\n",
    "\n",
    "- **24 layers total, 64 heads each**\n",
    "- **Even layers (0, 2, 4…22) = LOCAL** — sliding-window attention (~256-token window).  \n",
    "  All attention mass falls in the last ~256 tokens from the current position.  \n",
    "  **The injection payload is always within this window** (it sits right before the  \n",
    "  reasoning tokens in the sequence), so local layers can attend to it too.\n",
    "- **Odd layers (1, 3, 5…23) = GLOBAL** — attend to the full sequence.\n",
    "- **Attention sink at position 0** — layers 7 and 9 show a strong spike there  \n",
    "  (`mean pos-0 attn ≈ 0.12–0.15`). Position 0 is tracked separately so it doesn't  \n",
    "  swamp the payload signal in the span-group plots.\n",
    "\n",
    "All cells below filter to **N = 1** only.  \n",
    "Both local and global layers are shown; local/global is annotated on the x-axis."
   ]
